window.products.push({"id":1016088,"name":"WATSMAR Portable Blender, USB Rechargeable Personal Size Blender for Shakes & Smoothies, Mini Small Fruit Mixer Juicer with 50 Recipes, 4000mAh Batter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wbcBoRk9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Cordless & Portable Design】Traditional corded-electric blenders are not convenient to carry and cannot work outdoor when you have no access to AC power. So, our portable and rechargeable blender is designed to solve that problem perfectly! You can put it into backpack, gym bag, and blend and enjoy fresh juice when you are travelling, camping, gym and office. 【Rechargeable & Large-capacity Battery】Built-in 4000mAh battery and USB charging port, this portable blender could produce 15-20 cups of juices per charge, and you can charge it by AC adapter, power bank, computer or other USB power source. 【BPA Free & Food-Grade Material】 We strictly selected the raw materials of this portable blender, and choose BPA free & food-grade materials, allowing you to make shakes and smoothies, fruit & vegetable juices, facial mask and baby food with no worries. 【Upgraded 6 3D Blades】 Equipped with 6pcs super-sharp stainless steel blades, at a rotating speed of 22000 rpm, the blades enable you to crush through ice cube and frozen fruit within 35-40s, delicious smoothies have never been so easy! 【Smart Safety Protection】The built-in magnetic secure switch will make this personal blender stop blending when the cup part and base are not assembled tightly or correctly. Meanwhile, it comes with an overheating prevention.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wbcBoRk9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATSMAR","source_asin":"B09B7P8D1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B7P8D1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B7P8D1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
