window.products.push({"id":1016243,"name":"Vinyl Record Storage Display – Modern Exotic Album Storage Rack and Display Stand – Great for Bookshelves with Room for 33 Records or Your Favorite Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aw6bd5pES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Splash of the Hinterland, At Home You know style, you appreciate refinement. The soulful texture of an old LP playing unites the modern pieces of your home in their shared history. But collections need protection. Your carefully curated lot deserves a better fate than a dusty old box on a rarely acknowledged shelf. SalCo Enterprise has the alternative. Bring your impressive library back to the light of day with a stylish bamboo vinyl organizer that fits seamlessly into modern, minimalist decor. Made from real bamboo, SalCo Enterprise’s record rack adds a subtle streak of the Far East to your desk or bookshelf—reflect your worldly tastes in music with how you store it. The Whole Package Organization should require as little frustration as possible. That’s why we designed your bamboo vinyl record storage cabinet and turntable organizer to be ready within minutes of opening the box. Your package includes: 2 high quality bamboo panels, comprising the bottom and back of the organizer 2 high quality bamboo panels, comprising the bottom and back of the organizer 1 black iron restraining arm, to allow flipping through up to 33 records with no risk of dropping or breaking 1 black iron restraining arm, to allow flipping through up to 33 records with no risk of dropping or breaking 2 large and 4 small screws—the only hardware required! 2 large and 4 small screws—the only hardware required! 2 low-profile, barrel-shaped fixers—no screwing or hammering necessary!Discover SalCo QualitySalCo is a family-owned company that’s dedicated to sleek solutions for organizers with an eye for style. Created by dedicated music-lovers and book-readers, your bamboo book and vinyl stand is designed from the bottom up to enhance the look of wherever it’s displayed. It’s wide enough for the secure storage of up to 33 albums and books, with a thin enough profile to slip into cube storage shelves, bookshelves, or your desk.Your records are made for more than collecting dust. Relive memories and give your collection new life—make SalCo's bamboo vinyl record shelf organizer a centerpiece of your home, today! 2 low-profile, barrel-shaped fixers—no screwing or hammering necessary! Discover SalCo Quality SalCo is a family-owned company that’s dedicated to sleek solutions for organizers with an eye for style. Created by dedicated music-lovers and book-readers, your bamboo book and vinyl stand is designed from the bottom up to enhance the look of wherever it’s displayed. It’s wide enough for the secure storage of up to 33 albums and books, with a thin enough profile to slip into cube storage shelves, bookshelves, or your desk. Your records are made for more than collecting dust. Relive memories and give your collection new life—make SalCo's bamboo vinyl record shelf organizer a centerpiece of your home, today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aw6bd5pES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SV","source_asin":"B08M9JGR99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M9JGR99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M9JGR99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1016244,"name":"Emile Henry Lion's Head Soup Bowls, Set of 2, Azur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715S2xmpyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Marcigny, a small town nestled between the hills of Southern Burgundy, has been home to Emile Henry for the past 150 years. Faithful to its origins, the entire production is carried out here. Thanks to its clay, rich in refractory properties, Burgundy has remained a fertile area for potters, passing on their savoir-faire from generation to generation. Clay, a natural and noble material, has been used since the mists of the time to cook or preserve food. While respecting the traditional techniques, Emile Henry has introduced technological improvements (Ceradon ) so that the dishes are more resistant to mechanical and thermal shock. Strong and durable, all Emile Henry pieces can be taken directly from the freezer to a hot oven, can go under a broiler and are microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. The natural clay is unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. All pieces are perfect for everyday use and carry a 3 year warranty against defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715S2xmpyTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B001G8Y1IC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001G8Y1IC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001G8Y1IC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
