window.products.push({"id":1016342,"name":"Bruntmor, Kragler 34oz Double Wall 18/8 Steel French Coffee Press with Non Drip Spout & Double Filter (Kragler)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610TXVPJwuL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel French Press Step up your brunch game and glam up your breakfast table with this hot and stylish Bruntmor French press coffee pot. The polished mirror finish and clean design will stand out against all other coffee pots, and at the same time, it will compliment any kitchen décor. Keep Warm for 2 hours This pot can brew up to 8 cups (4 oz) of coffee or tea at once, so whether you want a quick cup in the morning, or enough to share with friends, this pot is perfect. With a rust free double-walled, insulated interior, this pot will keep its contents hot for up to 2 hours, so go ahead and stretch out your Sunday brunch. While the coffee inside stays piping hot, the inner insulation allows the carafe's outer surface to remain cool enough to be held, for easy pouring. This pot conveniently doubles as a serving piece, so you can brew and serve your coffee right from the dining table - no need to keep running back and forth to a hot plate. Unbreakable, 18/8 Stainless Steel Made of high-quality 18/8 stainless steel, this piece is naturally free of BPA. The stainless steel repels lingering flavors, so you can change up your beans or tea leaves without tasting whatever was brewed last. The carafe is dishwasher safe, and will not discolor or crack over time, the way a glass pot might. The three-piece stainless steel plunger features an ultra-fine mesh filter, so that you can get the most out of your beans. This filter allows subtle aromas and flavors to stand out, while preventing any sediment or grounds from making their way into your cup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610TXVPJwuL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bruntmor","source_asin":"B00ZB0G2O2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZB0G2O2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZB0G2O2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
