window.products.push({"id":1016402,"name":"Proctor Silex Temperature Control Electric Tea Kettle, Water Boiler & Heater, 1.7L, Cordless, Auto-Shutoff & Boil-Dry Protection, White (41007)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VxJmFq0LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect cup of tea is easy to make with the right kettle. The Proctor Silex 1. 7 liter temperature control electric hot water kettle, boiler & tea heater with auto-shutoff & boil-dry protection, White (41007) heats water quickly, so you'll have water prepared at the precise temperature for a variety of teas in no time. In addition to the standard boil function, choose from four pre-programmed temperature settings tailored for green, White, oolong, and black tea. Cord-free serving with an easy-pour spout makes sharing simple and convenient. And with a 1. 7 liter Capacity, there's enough for the whole family. The automatic shutoff feature with boil-dry protection keeps the kettle from scorching, making it safer than boiling water on the stovetop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VxJmFq0LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Proctor Silex","source_asin":"B074T6GX6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074T6GX6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074T6GX6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1016403,"name":"Delta Children – Justice League Twin Furniture Set, 3-Piece by DC Comics (Superman, Batman, Flash, Wonder Woman Upholstered Twin Bed | Storage Unit w/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z-0DP7xYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn any bedroom into a room fit for a hero with the DC Comics Justice League 3-Piece Twin Furniture Set. This set includes an Upholstered Twin Bed, 6 Cubby Deluxe Storage Unit and Area Rug that all showcase bold graphics of the World’s Greatest Super Heroes. JUSTICE LEAGUE UPHOLSTERED TWIN BED: Batman, Superman, Wonder Woman and Flash—come to rescue bedtime on this super-cool Twin Bed from Delta Children. Features a headboard with colorful graphics of the super hero team and a footboard with 3D appliques of their logos. Constructed with a sturdy wood frame and upholstered in a faux leather fabric to create a cozy and secure sleep space for your little vigilante. JUSTICE LEAGUE 6 CUBBY DELUXE STORAGE UNIT: from Delta Children keeps toys, books, games, or accessories organized. Features a sturdy wood frame that features six open cubbies and includes three bonus storage bins printed with Superman, Batman and Flash. This handy cube organizer is perfect as storage in the bedroom, playroom, living area—pretty much anywhere. JUSTICE LEAGUE AREA RUG: with Non-Slip Backing from Delta Children. Batman, Superman and Flash, this accent rug is the perfect choice for fans of the World’s Greatest Super Heroes. A super-cool addition to any kids’ bedroom, man cave or hang out spot, it features a soft, plush pile that makes it comfy to play on, sit on or walk on. Made from durable materials, it can withstand everyday wear and tear, so it's a great option for high-traffic areas around the house. Plus, there’s no need for a rug pad, this rug’s non-slip backing ensures it always stays in place. About Justice League: Greater than the sum of their awe-inspiring parts, the Justice League handles threats too massive for any single hero. Made up of the World’s Greatest Super Heroes, Superman, Batman, Wonder Woman, Flash, Green Lantern Aquaman and Cyborg, this A-team of crusaders can handle any cosmic foe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z-0DP7xYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Children","source_asin":"B07CQ8QCH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQ8QCH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQ8QCH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
