window.products.push({"id":1016596,"name":"Home Style Folding Electric Food Chopper Slicer Stainless Steel Blade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gOK9YTaEL.jpg","description":"Prepackaged sliced cheese is obviously not a good choice for your breakfast. When you want to make some fresh sandwiches to enjoy the afternoon with your friends, you have to use knives to slice the cheese, bacon, bread and other delicious food? Stop wasting your time! The most important thing: you know, how awful those sliced look! That is why you always need to keep this electric food slicer at hand! This slicer can also slices fruits, vegetables for salads. Great for preparing lunches, deli trays and buffet foods for entertaining. Features: * Brand new in package and ready to ship. * CE, GS, ROHS, LFGB Certificate. * 6.5\" diam. Serrated Blade made of 420J Stainless Steel. * 0-13mm adjustable thickness. * Sturdy and easy to clean ABS housing. * Easy to operate on/off Switch. * Press on dual Safety Button. * ABS Food Pusher for more protection when slicing. * ABS Food plate for the sliced. * Folding design for room saving storage. * Slicer boneless meats, cheeses and breads. Or vegetables for salads. * 4 nonslip feet for steady located when running. * Voltage Frequency: 110 volt / 60 Hz * Power: 100W * This appliance complies with the directive relating to food contact materials. Dimensions: - Fold-up Size: 12 1/2\" L x 4\" W X 8 1/4\" H - Working Base: 12 1/2\" L x 11\" W - Pusher Face: 4\" x 5\" - Tray: 8 3/4\" L x 4 3/4\" W - Power Cord Length: 47\" Package Includes: 1 x Electric Food Slicer 1 x ABS Food Pusher 1 x ABS Plate 1 x User Instruction Warnings: The Food Pusher is part of the basic unit of this appliance. Using the appliance without it would be dangerous. This appliance is designed to be used continuously for a maximum of 10 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gOK9YTaEL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic Brand","source_asin":"B00B5KAB7Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B5KAB7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B5KAB7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
