window.products.push({"id":1016682,"name":"Armors Gloves (Set of 2) - BBQ & Grill Heat Resistant Gloves with Extra-long Cuff - Elaborate Top Class BBQ Glove - Hot Surface Handler - Use As Oven ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SFj7841pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"\"Armors Gloves is an insulated glove or mitten usually worn in the kitchen to easily protect your hand from hot objects such as ovens, stoves, cookware, etc. It will be the best Oven Protective Gloves You'll Ever Had! Best For: * Oven, Grill & Barbecue * Silicon texturing for ultimate grip * Handles hot objects on the grill * Putting logs inyo a hot fire * Handing hot pots and pans  * Bonfire and fireworks * Camping, caravans and boats * Changing light bulbs Product Features * Heat Resistant For Temperatures Up To 662F. * Each one can wear on left or right hand. Extended length provides superior coverage of the wrist and lower arm. * The silicone gloves also have a textured surface which provides a firm grip. * Wear this glove can assure that you've got a great, heat resistant grip. Why choose Armors Gloves? -Armors Gloves are heat resistant up to 662 degrees Fahrenheit,they will fully protect your hands at high oven temperatures. -Outer layer is made with Para-Aramid fiber because of it's excellent thermal protection, strength and durability. It is FIVE times more powerful than steel on an equal-weight basis. -Inside layer is made of 100% cotton,textiles can be light-weight, comfy and thermally safer. -Armors Gloves are made with stain-proof silicone and can be washed easily in the dishwasher to keep them looking brand-new. Nobody wants to buy new oven gloves every year, and now you don't have to since Armors Gloves come with an amazing lifetime guarantee. Warning: The Armors Gloves is not a permanent protection against heat and flames, but can extend the amount of time you are able to hold a hot objects.  Do not use if glove is wet. Not waterproof. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SFj7841pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armors Gloves","source_asin":"B00NXZ5QRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NXZ5QRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NXZ5QRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
