window.products.push({"id":1016685,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom,XAMATTS Cool Mist Humidifiers for Large Room,Baby,Home,Plants,3.5L Ultrasonic Air Humidifier with Essential Oil,Smart Humidity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nGvzbts+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CUSTOM HUMIDITY & ADJUST MIST:This top-fill humidifier can be customized to your desired humidity level. If the humidity reaches the set value, it will stop spraying and enter the standby state. If the humidity falls below the desired level, it will automatically start up again. This humidifier has 4 mist level, including low, medium, high and sleep mode mist level allows you to adjust the mist output to find the great humidity level for your home. TOP FILLING & LARGE CAPACITY:The XAMATTS Cool Mist Ultrasonic humidifier is easy and convenient to refill,just remove the lid to add purified water directly into the water tank. Plus, it has a large water tank that can hold up to 3.5 liters of water, which can last up to 15 hours, making it a great choice for humidifying a large space. TIMER & AUTO SHUT-OFF:The air humidifier has a time setting feature(1h/2h/4h/6h)that lets you choose how long you want it to run. The humidifier automatically turns off when it runs out of water, so it doesn't damage the unit or pose a safety hazard. AROMA DIFFUSER & WHISPER-QUIET:The essential oil diffuser humidifier with essential oil tray,suitable for bedroom/nursery/apartments/office to establish a comfortable and warm atmosphere.produce a near silent frequency 25dB ensuring ultra quiet operation for a full night of sleep. Is a great choice for anyone looking for a quality aromatherapy diffuser as well as a whisper-quiet machine. EASY to USE & CLEAN:The humidifier has a friendly intelligent LED operation interface, which is easy to operate at night, and you can customize the humidity and mist level. Designed with6.7 inches (17cm) large opening, XAMATTS humidifiers for bedroom is really convenient for your daily clean and easy to refill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nGvzbts+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XAMATTS","source_asin":"B09TDMNZFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TDMNZFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TDMNZFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
