window.products.push({"id":1016721,"name":"ZXBSWELE Set of 2 Button Tufted Dining Chair with Solid Wood Legs for Dining Room Living Room, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6eTuSL2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose ZXBSWELE chairs? ZXBSWELE chairs use solid wood (rubber wood) material on frame and legs because solid wood have premium material properties and it is broadly applied in decoration material and furniture manufacturing. Solid wood is sturdy and durable, wood lines is natural, most of them send forth the fragrance of natural wood material. It's good hygroscopicity and air permeability make ZXBSWELE chairs environmentally friendly and chemical free. All wood constructions are reinforced to provide a stable support. SPECIFICATION Material : Linen Fabric/Rubber Wood Maximum Load Capacity : 300lbs Seat Width : 16.54'' Seat Length : 18.11'' Leg Length : 14.57'' Total Height : 38.58'' Total Width : 23.62'' Apply to dining table with 29.5''-33.5'' height NOTE 1. Please screw the bolts as tight as you can when you are putting it together so that it won’t become wobbly easily. When you are connecting the back and seat or assembling the legs, please line up all the bolts and holes, screw in all the bolts but semitighten them instead of screwing in and tightening the bolt firmly one after another. This is to give you some forgiveness to adjust the screws and avoid “not line up” situation.  2.The color of the actual chair may be slightly different from that in the picture due to a different screen display. About ZXBSWELE All ZXBSWELE chairs are designed and manufactured by our professional factory which is engaged in producing dining chair for many years. We produce dining chairs strictly according to the industrial standard and all our chair are manufactured through strict test and quality control. We focus on providing high-quality chairs and all-around service to you. ZXBSWELE never let you down!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6eTuSL2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZXBSWELE","source_asin":"B076BNBX65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BNBX65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BNBX65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
