window.products.push({"id":1016751,"name":"Luckore Mason Jars Wide Mouth 16 oz Set of 12, Canning Glass Jars with Metal Airtight Lids, Ideal for Meal Prep, Food Storage, Canning, Fermenting, Ja","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pBofnU3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luckore Wide Mouth Glass Mason Jars 16 oz/ 12 Pack Canning Jars with Lids Simple & Practical Design These large-capacity jars are great for homemade making, meal prep, kitchen storage, and pantry organization. They are dishwasher safe so that you can clean them with the dishwasher freeing your hands. Premium Split-type Lid Design The mason jar lids are composed of 2 parts: sealing rings and bands. With the split-type lid design, mason jars have better performance in canning, fermenting, and homemade jam making. While The screw thread on the mouth increases the friction force of hands making it easy to twist on and twist off the lids. Easy Food Storage Our mason jars make food storage easy, You can store nuts, granola, coffee, etc. in these glass canning jars, or use it to make homemade food such as pickles, jams, salads, etc. Through the transparent glass, you can see clearly the status of the food. In a word, this set of glass jars is suitable for use on several occasions to meet all your food storage needs. Anti-slip Bottom Friability is one of the most common problems with glassware, while in the kitchen it's easy to knock over glass jars cracking them. To solve that, we added a non-slip screw on the bottom of the mason jars, which highly improved their stability. Keep Food Clean & FreshThanks to the sealing ring inside the canning lids, the food in the storage jars can be kept fresh for a long time. The rust-resistant lids and the eco-friendly glass keeps the food inside clean away. Specification: Diameter: 2.76 Inch ( 80mm ) Height: 4.72 Inch ( 170mm ) Capacity: 16 oz ( 500ml ) Quantity: 12 Pcs/ Pack Tips: You can put the jars in the fridge and dishwasher for storage and easy cleanout, but it's not recommended to put the mason jars in a freezer or microwave oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pBofnU3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luckore","source_asin":"B08NJJJQZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NJJJQZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NJJJQZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
