window.products.push({"id":1016792,"name":"Top Collection St. George Slaying The Dragon Statue - St. George, Legendary Medieval Knight Sculpture in Cold-Cast Bronze with Color Accents - 10.5-In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":148.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cSYE9mpEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ EXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP - Premium sculpted cold-cast bronze - real bronze powder mixed with resin. Hand-painted color accents on the bronze finish to give a high-quality antique look without sacrificing the details. The intricate craftsmanship of this brand is simply breathtaking.   ✔️ COLLECTIBLE - Measures 10.5 inches tall, 11.5 inches wide. Perfect decor to display in your home, office, or library. Perfect addition to any medieval collection.   ✔️ UNIQUE PRESENT – Packed in a beautiful gift-box ready for any occasion. Ideal for friends or relatives that love dragons, knights, or medieval legends.   ✔️ STUNNING PRESENTATION - Painted and illustrated by countless artists from the Crusades to the Renaissance, the legend of St. George and the Dragon is modeled wonderfully in this recreation. The attention to detail in the armor, the horse, and the dragon is exceptional. The hand-painted color accents elevates this from a simple bronze statue to a true work of art.   ✔️ ST. GEORGE - The origins of this legend vary, some say that St. George was a Roman soldier, a Crusader knight, or possibly pre-Christianity myths. In this version, St. George slays the Dragon that is terrorizing a town in Libya, and the lord sacrifices his only daughter as tribute. George kills the dragon, saves the princess, and converted the city to Christianity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cSYE9mpEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Collection","source_asin":"B0019VSYLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0019VSYLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0019VSYLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
