window.products.push({"id":1016924,"name":"Automatic Milk Dispenser for Fridge, Magic drink Tap for Milk Juice Beer Spill Proof, Hands-Free, Kids Tap Automatic Drink Dispenser for Parties Weddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fHb-5MolS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🥛Features:  ✔️Universal cap fits most containers ✔️Kids can help themselves ✔️Enjoy hands-free dispensing ✔️Eliminates heavy lifting & pouring ✔️No more drips or spills ✔️Easy to clean  🧃Parameter： Type: Automatic Drink Dispenser Material: PP, ABS Power By: 2 x AA Batteries (Not Included) Occasions: home, kitchen, office, school, picnic, etc Dimension: 13.58 \"x 2.44\" x 4.40 \"(Approx.) Bottle mouth diameter: 1.77\"(Approx.)  🍺Package Contains: 2 x Automatic Drink Dispensers (Batteries Not Included)  🙅‍♂️NOT Recommended for: Carbonated beverages; Beverages containing pulp; Beverages containing Sarsaparilla or Sarsaparilla emulating flavor (root beer); Beverages with 40% or more alcohol content; Beverages beyond their stated expiration date.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fHb-5MolS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LARAKA","source_asin":"B098K4KN1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098K4KN1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098K4KN1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1016925,"name":"Elegear Faux Fur Throw Blanket - Super Soft Fuzzy Throw Blanket for Couch, Sofa, Bed, Fall, Winter - Cozy Warm Fluffy Decorative Brown Throw Blanket -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xzOiDoRwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile Blanket& Best Holiday Gifts- Our soft blanket with 3D snowflake printed patterns will not only keep you warm and comfortable during the winter season, but also perfectly match your wintry home decoration. This fuzzy blanket makes the perfect partner for reading by the fire or settling in for movie night.This soft blanket will also be a great gift idea for Valentine's Day or various festivals for your loved ones. Super-Soft faux fur blanket- Our fuzzy throw blanket’s front is made of faux fur fabric in front: animal-friendly, yet providing the warmth and texture of real fur. It feels buttery soft, lending substantial comfort whether you cocoon yourself in your warm blanket for a movie night, or just drape it across your bed. The back is made of quality sherpa fabric, so you’ll be warm whichever way the winter blanket is turned. More Warmth from New High Technology - In our newly developed fuzzy blanket, we’ve added moisture-absorbent heating yarn, which absorbs the moisture generated by the human body over time, and continuously converts that moisture into heat to quickly raise the temperature by2 ℃~5℃, keeping you warm all night. Also, the fabric’s high weight of 310+200GSM makes it warmer than other blankets. In fall and winter, you just need one Elegear warm blanket. Easy to Care For & Shed-free - This sherpa blanket is machine-washable and tumble-dry. Put it in cold or warm water below 30 degrees Celsius (= 86 degrees Fahrenheit), add detergent, and let the washing machine do the rest! After the cozy blanket is washed, it will not shed, pill, or knot, and it is friendly to sensitive skin. Also, it’s anti-static and wrinkle-resistant, bringing you the ultimate in comfort. What You Get - A beautifully packaged 50\"x60\" faux fur throw blanket for couch or anywhere. Our faux fur blanket is STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certified, so you can use it sigh confidence as the perfect accessory for the cooler months. This soft throw blankets adds instant warmth and luxury to your home. It isn’t just for your bed—anywhere you might lounge can be a furry nest of comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xzOiDoRwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegear","source_asin":"B08HQRT1PV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1016925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HQRT1PV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HQRT1PV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
